ammadiyah 1 Blora","right_description":{"en":"<ul><li>Langkah-langkah strategis untuk mewujudkan Misi SMK Muhammadiyah 1 Blora<\\/li><li>Mengembangkan potensi peserta didik berperilaku sesuai norma dan etika.<\\/li><li>Meningkatkan kompetensi peserta didik sesuai SNP dan LSP.<\\/li><li>Mengembangkan potensi peserta didik menjadi wirausahawan kreatif dan inovatif.<\\/li><li>Mengembangkan kemampuan komunikasi interaktif dengan dukungan IT.<\\/li><li>Mengembangkan potensi peserta didik berwawasan lingkungan dan kearifan lokal.<\\/li><\\/ul><p><br class=\\"softbreak\\"><\\/p>"},"right_sub_heading":"Langkah-langkah strategis untuk mewujudkan Misi SMK Muhammadiyah 1 Blora"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":12,"type":"a17-block-stats","is_repeater":false,"editor_name":"default","content":{"title_main":"Pengalaman","title_highlight":"& Mutu Pendidikan"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":{"stat_item":[{"id":1790251129644,"type":"a17-block-stat_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"number":"20","suffix":"YR","label":"YEARS EXPERIENCE"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":1790251165906,"type":"a17-block-stat_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"number":"5","suffix":"+","label":"Jurusan"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":1790251190924,"type":"a17-block-stat_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"number":"85","suffix":"%","label":"Serapan Kerja"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":1790251194269,"type":"a17-block-stat_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"number":"50","suffix":"%","label":"Melanjutkan PTN"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":[]}]}},{"id":1790251625230,"type":"a17-block-card","is_repeater":false,"editor_name":"default","content":{"title_main":"Sarana","title_highlight":"& Prasarana"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":{"card_item":[{"id":1790251686186,"type":"a17-block-card_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"title":"Gedung Milik Sendiri","description":"Ruang Kelas yang besar, bersih dan rapih"},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"b