MK Muhammadiyah 1 Blora"},"content":{"en":"Insya Allah, saya pilih Dinkominfo Blora karena ingin menimba ilmu serta belajar bersama dengan Bapak dan Ibu yang membidangi di Dinkominfo Blora. Dinkominfo Blora idola siswa jurusan DKV."}},"medias":{"avatar":[{"id":3,"name":"logo_smk.png","thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png?fm=jpg&q=60&fit=max&dpr=1&h=256","original":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png","medium":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png?fm=jpg&q=80&fit=max&h=430","width":250,"height":300,"tags":[],"deleteUrl":null,"updateUrl":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/admin\\/media-library\\/medias\\/single-update","updateBulkUrl":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/admin\\/media-library\\/medias\\/bulk-update","deleteBulkUrl":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/admin\\/media-library\\/medias\\/bulk-delete","metadatas":{"default":{"caption":null,"altText":"Logo smk","video":null},"custom":{"caption":null,"altText":null,"video":null}},"disabled":false,"crops":{"default":{"name":"default","x":0,"y":9,"width":250,"height":250},"desktop":{"name":"desktop","x":0,"y":9,"width":250,"height":250}}}]},"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":1790253926817,"type":"a17-block-testimonial_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"rating":"5","name":{"en":"Intan Nur Aini"},"role":{"en":"Siswi SMK Muhammadiyah 1 Blora"},"content":{"en":"Iyaaa menyenangkan, bisa membuat rileks pikiran jadi plong yang mulanya pusing jadi senang acaranya seru tempatnya juga enak pokoknya jadi kenangan terindah sama temen-teman dan guru. Tapi sampai rumah capek semua karena outbound-nya menantang."}},"medias":[],"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":1790253925439,"type":"a17-block-testimonial_item","is_repeater":true,"content":{"rating":"5","role":{"en":"Siswa Jurusan TBSM 1"},"content":{"en":"Tiga tahun kami belajar di sekolah ini adalah masa