u. Tapi sampai rumah capek semua karena outbound-nya menantang."}},"medias":{"avatar":[{"id":3,"name":"logo_smk.png","thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png?fm=jpg&q=60&fit=max&dpr=1&h=256","original":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png","medium":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png?fm=jpg&q=80&fit=max&h=430","width":250,"height":300,"tags":[],"deleteUrl":null,"updateUrl":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/panel-maintenance\\/media-library\\/medias\\/single-update","updateBulkUrl":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/panel-maintenance\\/media-library\\/medias\\/bulk-update","deleteBulkUrl":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/panel-maintenance\\/media-library\\/medias\\/bulk-delete","metadatas":{"default":{"caption":null,"altText":"Logo smk","video":null},"custom":{"caption":null,"altText":null,"video":null}},"pivot_id":133,"crops":{"default":{"pivot_id":133,"name":"default","width":250,"height":250,"x":0,"y":9},"desktop":{"pivot_id":134,"name":"desktop","width":250,"height":250,"x":0,"y":9}}}]},"browsers":[],"blocks":[]},{"id":52,"type":"a17-block-testimonial_item","is_repeater":true,"editor_name":"default","content":{"rating":"5","role":{"en":"Siswa Jurusan TBSM 1"},"content":{"en":"Tiga tahun kami belajar di sekolah ini adalah masa yang penuh kenangan. Kami diajarkan bukan hanya teori dan praktik, tapi juga nilai-nilai kehidupan. Terutama Bu Retno, sosok guru yang sangat membekas bagi kami. Beliau tegas, tapi penuh kasih. Tak hanya mengajar, tapi juga mendidik kami dengan hati."},"name":{"en":"Dhewangga Aji"}},"medias":{"avatar":[{"id":3,"name":"logo_smk.png","thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk.png?fm=jpg&q=60&fit=max&dpr=1&h=256","original":"https:\\/\\/smkmuh1blora.sch.id\\/img\\/0b10cb49-a771-4490-84f9-0670481af382\\/logo-smk